; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5732                    CanTp_TxGetFreeChannelPtr and checked to be not NULL.
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5733                    The handle parameter to get the channel must be valid. It is passed to CanTp_TxStartConnection() in
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5734                    CanTp_Transmit. There it is derived from the CanTpTxSduId parameter via the CanTp_TxSduSnv2Hdl indirection
