; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5740    \DESCRIPTION    pTpTxState is used as function parameter to CanTp_TxInit in order to reset the connection. The pointer is
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5741                    retrieved by CanTp_TxGetActiveChannelPtr and checked to be not NULL.
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5742                    The handle parameter to get the channel must be valid. It is retrieved via the CanTp_TxSduSnv2Hdl
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  5743                    indirection table (macro CanTp_TxGetSduHdlBySduId). The range and the availability (in case of post
