; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6115  \CM CM_CANTP_RXMAXPAYLOADLENGTH   For all Rx N-SDUs, CanTp_RxCfg_GetMaxPayload must be less or equal CANTP_MAX_PAYLOAD_LENGTH
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6116  \CM CM_CANTP_TXMAXPAYLOADLENGTH   For all Tx N-SDUs, CanTp_TxCfg_GetMaxPayload must be less or equal CANTP_MAX_PAYLOAD_LENGTH
; ..\BSW\CanTp\CanTp.c	  6117  
